WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.417 --> 00:00:03.212
(Clock ticking)
(School bell ringing)

00:00:03.212 --> 00:00:04.546
I want everyone to answer this
question, alright?

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:06.632
 I'll give you a second to
think about it.

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:09.593
Now, raise your hand if you
think you're a lucky person.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:12.179
Just Ramon.

00:00:12.179 --> 00:00:13.764
Okay, raise your hand if you
think you're unlucky.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:17.768
Got it. Okay, put your
hands down.

00:00:17.768 --> 00:00:18.518
♪♪

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:20.062
Student:
What about you, Mr. Corman? 

00:00:20.062 --> 00:00:20.812
What's that?

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:22.606
Student:
You didn't raise your hand.

00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:27.486
Me, uh..no, I...I mean, I feel
like a lucky person. 

00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:30.572
(Singing)

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:33.534
I'm having anxiety or panic or
something. Both.

00:00:33.534 --> 00:00:34.993
(Screaming)

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:36.745
Victor:
What's the difference?

00:00:36.745 --> 00:00:38.455
I'm gonna need a sub for
today.

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.040
(Singing)

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.250
Victor:
What's bothering you?

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:41.875
Everything.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:46.046
It just feels like I blew the
whole thing, like I suck as a
person.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.882
You're not entitled to a
perfect partner or a perfect
life.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.717
(Singing)

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.387
I didn't leave you because you
became a teacher.

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:56.682
I left because I thought I was
doing what I love with the man
I love.

00:00:56.682 --> 00:00:59.226
♪ To see me through ♪

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:00.560
Ruth:
How was your weekend?

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.270
It was great.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:02.145
Oh, you're some big man now!

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:02.813
You guys walk away.

00:01:02.813 --> 00:01:03.855
(Yelling)

00:01:03.855 --> 00:01:06.400
(Glass shattering)

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.651
(Bell ringing)

00:01:09.278 --> 00:01:10.570
Alright, good morning. 
Happy Monday.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.864
♪♪

00:01:12.864 --> 00:01:15.033
Everything is a complete
disaster.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:17.953
You have the privilege of
expecting everything to just
work out.

00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:20.956
Now that you're
faced with some adversity...

00:01:21.999 --> 00:01:23.709
Mandy:
It could feel like the end of
the world.

00:01:24.126 --> 00:01:25.210
You want to stop feeling like
you're feeling?

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:27.045
Victor:
What about this weighted
blanket?

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:28.171
It costs two-hundred fifty
dollars. 

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:29.506
We can make our own version.

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:31.425
You can't make your own
version.

00:01:34.845 --> 00:01:35.762
You feeling less anxious?

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:36.888
No, I'm really not.

00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:38.223
♪♪

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:41.435
You can't stop thinking about
all the things you should've
done and why you didn't do them.

00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:44.229
♪♪

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:46.815
♪ When I was a boy ♪

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:48.692
Josh:
I know I can be negative
sometimes. 

00:01:48.692 --> 00:01:49.484
♪♪

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:50.610
It's not how I want to be. 

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.987
♪ Now I wonder how ♪

00:01:51.987 --> 00:01:54.114
Ruth:
Nothing is perfect.

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.991
I don't know why that's so
hard for you to see.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:59.161
♪♪

00:01:59.161 --> 00:02:02.664
Ruth:
The question is, what do you do
now?

00:02:02.664 --> 00:02:05.000
♪ When your name is just a name. ♪

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.960
♪ Name is just a name. ♪

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.211
 ♪♪

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:08.837
♪ Just a name. ♪

